1
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:03,330
[KAZUMA] A princess, huh?

2
00:00:03,830 --> 00:00:05,960
Sounds like she's probably
younger than I am.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,040
Well, who knows?

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:09,080
If we make friends,
maybe she'll call me

5
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:10,420
"Big Brother!"

6
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,290
- [DARKNESS] Uh, Kazuma.
- Huh.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,790
W-why not reconsider this?

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,580
You should just pass
on their offer. Please?

9
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,960
The nation's most important
people will be there!

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,460
All right, that's it,
I've had enough!

11
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,670
You already shot down my idea
of entertaining them

12
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,500
in a traditional kimono
and hakama!

13
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,290
You wanted to "entertain"
royalty in clothes

14
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,750
they have never heard of!

15
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,830
Listen to me.

16
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,500
I am willing to wear this
til the princess arrives

17
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:35,580
and that is why I expect you
to dress in a proper manner!

18
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:36,830
Shut your hole!

19
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:39,420
I don't wanna hear anything
but, "Very good, Master!"

20
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,630
[whimper]

21
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:45,000
Yes, very good, Master,
please forgive me.

22
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,580
After all, I am nothing
but a lowly sow.

23
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:50,040
I'm pretty sure
I didn't say all that.

24
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:24,040
[indistinct chatter]

25
00:02:24,130 --> 00:02:27,460
[sighs] Thank you,
I feel so much more relaxed

26
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:28,540
wearing these clothes.

27
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:29,790
The only reason
I said you could

28
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:31,670
is cause you were
beggin' and cryin'.

29
00:02:31,830 --> 00:02:33,880
You do realize
I am a noble, right?

30
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,040
So, I could never go around...

31
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:37,000
Caught you grinnin' when you
thought no one could see.

32
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,290
Did not!

33
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,330
Hey, you two
don't start lagging behind.

34
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:43,500
Relax, don't worry so much.

35
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:46,420
Just gotta wrap up this deal
before we see the princess.

36
00:02:47,170 --> 00:02:49,210
[WIZ] They all came in
a few moments ago!

37
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:52,170
The new products
that Kazuma designed, himself!

38
00:02:52,250 --> 00:02:54,210
Of course, if it wasn't
for my assistance,

39
00:02:54,290 --> 00:02:55,790
they would've
never been completed!

40
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,210
Yeah, yeah, sure.

41
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:59,630
Even though they're
convenient tools from my home.

42
00:02:59,710 --> 00:03:00,880
[munching]

43
00:03:02,830 --> 00:03:04,380
[all gasp]

44
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,420
Impressive that is convenient!

45
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,630
Something like this
is bound to sell, Kazuma!

46
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:10,170
I'm proudest of the one
that's modeled

47
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:11,540
after the Destroyer!

48
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:14,130
Flint and strikers will be
a thing of the past, now.

49
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:16,170
So I could definitely
use one, too.

50
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:17,710
[WIZ]
You're welcome to take one.

51
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:19,920
[MEGUMIN] Me too,
I want to have one, as well!

52
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,710
[giggle]

53
00:03:21,790 --> 00:03:23,830
Why is everyone getting
so excited?

54
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,290
I mean, they're only lighters.

55
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:26,830
- [AQUA] Well, maybe I'll...
- [thumps]

56
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:33,170
What the heck was that?
I want to pick a lighter, too.

57
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:34,580
Sorry Aqua,
but you've gotta pay.

58
00:03:34,670 --> 00:03:36,250
Huh, are you kidding me?

59
00:03:36,330 --> 00:03:38,000
The rest of 'em get to pick
any one they want

60
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,460
so why can't I have a lighter?

61
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:41,710
Because you didn't lift
a single finger!

62
00:03:42,210 --> 00:03:44,710
Megumin took the time
to help put 'em together!

63
00:03:44,790 --> 00:03:46,750
Darkness got things moving
by hookin' me up

64
00:03:46,830 --> 00:03:48,080
with a major wholesaler!

65
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:49,420
And what did you do?

66
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:51,040
Nap all day at the mansion!

67
00:03:51,130 --> 00:03:53,170
If you want a share,
go out and drum up

68
00:03:53,250 --> 00:03:54,540
some business or something!

69
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,080
[whimpers]

70
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:58,080
- [door opens]
- [screams]

71
00:03:58,170 --> 00:04:00,580
You're such
a good-for-nothing, Kazuma!

72
00:04:01,330 --> 00:04:02,920
And here I was to be quiet

73
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,540
about your little habit
of sniffing our dirty laundry!

74
00:04:05,670 --> 00:04:08,500
Well, those days are over,
you understand me?

75
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:10,670
You're nothing but an ingrate!

76
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,750
I think everyone
gets the point here!

77
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,580
Stop looking at me like that!

78
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:17,250
[indistinct chatter]

79
00:04:17,330 --> 00:04:19,040
[AQUA] And, now,
for my next trick,

80
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:21,290
I'll take what seems
to be just a regular,

81
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:22,960
run-of-the-mill handkerchief

82
00:04:23,290 --> 00:04:26,790
and then from nowhere
make white doves appear!

83
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:30,290
[crowd gasping]

84
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,130
Oh man, what is she even doing?

85
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:33,750
Did she forget
why she's out there?

86
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:36,040
More! Do some more tricks
like that one!

87
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:38,380
Yeah, and make it even wilder!

88
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,630
That's okay, you can keep
all your donations.

89
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:42,540
Please, I'm not
a professional entertainer,

90
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,670
so you don't need to throw me
all your coins.

91
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,960
[MAN 02-D (M)] Don't say that!

92
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,670
Let us reward
your amazing performance!

93
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,210
Listen up, woman!

94
00:04:50,290 --> 00:04:52,210
First, you sprayed
some holy water on the street

95
00:04:52,290 --> 00:04:54,330
and this establishments
doorknob.

96
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:55,920
Now you're just
resorting to obstructing

97
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,420
the place entirely, huh?

98
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:00,040
Why don't you mind
your own business, stupid mask?

99
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:02,130
This happens to be
a public street.

100
00:05:02,210 --> 00:05:04,790
What's so wrong with putting
on a show for these people?

101
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,500
[VANIR]
Stop your incessant rambling!

102
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:08,000
This is a crucial day for us!

103
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,420
We're launching a new product!

104
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:11,630
I'm putting an end
to your sabotage!

105
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,380
- [WIZ] Everyone!
- Huh.

106
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:15,630
A wonderful, brand new item
was just delivered

107
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:18,040
to our store, today
and I'd love to demonstrate it

108
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:19,290
for each one of you!

109
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:22,040
[KAZUMA] Woah, Wiz is acting
like a real business owner!

110
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:24,000
[AQUA]
Hey, let go of me, Darkness!

111
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:26,130
These people are ready
for another show!

112
00:05:26,210 --> 00:05:27,210
Thank you so much!

113
00:05:27,290 --> 00:05:29,290
Please, come back again
soon, okay?

114
00:05:29,380 --> 00:05:32,460
So, that'll be two lighters
and a Vanir mask, then?

115
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:34,040
[WIZ] Sure, coming right up!

116
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:36,540
[laughing]

117
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:39,330
You have my renewed thanks,
boy who's quite anxious

118
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:41,880
at the lack of new developments
after a promising encounter

119
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,540
with a friend
while on vacation!

120
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,290
Yeah, whatever,
just shut up, man!

121
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:47,500
I am not anxious at all,
understand me!

122
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:49,460
And you need to quit
lookin' at me like that!

123
00:05:49,710 --> 00:05:51,130
[gasps]
What are you talking about?

124
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:52,790
I wasn't doing any such thing!

125
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,460
Get a grip, and don't lose
your composure

126
00:05:54,540 --> 00:05:56,170
based on what
some demon tells you!

127
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:58,330
[VANIR]
Well, more importantly.

128
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:01,380
At this right I'd say your cut
of three hundred million eris

129
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:03,500
will be ready
in just a matter of time.

130
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:05,380
In exchange
for your patience boy,

131
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:06,790
I offer you this mask.

132
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,920
[KAZUMA] What is that?

133
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,420
[VANIR] It's one of my
mass-produced Vanir Masks.

134
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,880
Put it on during
a moonlit night

135
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,210
to improve your magic power,
blood circulation,

136
00:06:14,290 --> 00:06:15,880
and complexion!

137
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,210
It'll keep you
at the very top of your game!

138
00:06:18,330 --> 00:06:19,330
As if that weren't enough,

139
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:21,960
yours happens to be
a rare, black redeco.

140
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,790
Soon, every child
will envy you!

141
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,540
[laughs]

142
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,920
[KAZUMA]
Something happened that day

143
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,580
I never imagined I'd see.

144
00:06:28,830 --> 00:06:31,460
Business was really boomin'
at Wiz's store.

145
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:34,080
And then, at last.

146
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,500
[grunt]

147
00:06:36,420 --> 00:06:38,790
All right, ladies
d'ya know what to do?

148
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,000
Absolutely!

149
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,710
I can blow their minds
with all my best party tricks.

150
00:06:42,790 --> 00:06:44,790
That way, Darkness
is sure to be proud of us!

151
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:47,500
As for me, I'll make
an awe-inspiring entrance

152
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:48,830
to surprise the princess!

153
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,790
Kazuma, you have
any idea where I could get

154
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:53,210
my hands on fireworks
and explosive smoke?

155
00:06:53,790 --> 00:06:56,130
[KAZUMA] I've got
a bad feeling about this.

156
00:06:56,290 --> 00:06:57,500
- [door opens]
- Huh.

157
00:06:57,670 --> 00:06:59,080
[DARKNESS] Everyone.

158
00:06:59,170 --> 00:07:01,380
I must say,
it is my great pleasure,

159
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:03,290
as Lalatina Dustiness-Ford

160
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:05,420
to serve as your hostess
for today.

161
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:07,920
[chuckles]

162
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,250
- [Megumin gasping]
- Ooh, Darkness...

163
00:07:10,290 --> 00:07:12,710
[Kazuma groaning]

164
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,960
[AQUA] Hey, this is feeling
pretty baggy.

165
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:19,830
Don't you have
something more fitted?

166
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,080
Uh, well, what can I tell you?

167
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:24,880
A Crusader does need
to have some muscles.

168
00:07:25,210 --> 00:07:27,290
[gasps] Is something
wrong, Megumin?

169
00:07:28,670 --> 00:07:29,750
[grunts]

170
00:07:32,210 --> 00:07:33,210
Hm.

171
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,330
[groans]

172
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:39,000
I put the dress on
and it falls right off of me.

173
00:07:39,710 --> 00:07:41,290
Could I get a smaller one?

174
00:07:41,670 --> 00:07:44,130
Oh, uh, yes,
that might be possible

175
00:07:44,210 --> 00:07:46,710
but that dress was from back
when I was a little girl, so...

176
00:07:46,790 --> 00:07:48,080
[screaming]

177
00:07:48,170 --> 00:07:49,290
[DARKNESS] Oh, be careful!

178
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:51,000
Please do not pull my braids!

179
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,290
Wait, what are those things?

180
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:54,000
They look like smoke bombs
and explosive potions

181
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,580
for chasing away monsters!

182
00:07:55,670 --> 00:07:56,830
Hand them over!

183
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,290
[Megumin screams]

184
00:07:58,670 --> 00:08:00,540
Well, what do you think?

185
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,000
Cute?

186
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:03,210
Oh!

187
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:06,000
Hm. Mm.

188
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:08,420
Uh, hey,

189
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:10,420
why are you staring
at me like that?

190
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:11,880
[chuckles]

191
00:08:12,540 --> 00:08:14,330
Okay now, listen.

192
00:08:14,790 --> 00:08:16,710
You must be on your
best behavior in there.

193
00:08:16,790 --> 00:08:18,290
Just one out-of-place comment

194
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:19,960
and it could cost you
your head.

195
00:08:20,290 --> 00:08:21,880
Um, is there something wrong?

196
00:08:23,790 --> 00:08:25,710
Look, I should
let you guys know.

197
00:08:26,790 --> 00:08:28,380
If they end up wanting
to keep me around,

198
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:30,000
then I'm gonna need
to move out.

199
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:32,420
And I don't see any other
way around it, honestly.

200
00:08:32,710 --> 00:08:35,040
That's just how it is,
so prepare yourselves.

201
00:08:35,130 --> 00:08:37,540
Exactly how far along
has this fantasy progressed

202
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:39,170
inside that brain of yours?

203
00:08:40,170 --> 00:08:41,250
[DARKNESS] Here's the plan.

204
00:08:41,330 --> 00:08:44,080
I will entertain Princess Iris
while the rest of you

205
00:08:44,170 --> 00:08:46,500
enjoy the meal
and nod along, respectfully.

206
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,080
All right, show time!

207
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:52,040
[door opens]

208
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:56,040
♪

209
00:08:57,750 --> 00:09:00,250
[DARKNESS] Apologies
for the wait, Princess Iris.

210
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:02,630
At this time, I would like
to present my friends

211
00:09:02,710 --> 00:09:06,670
and fellow adventurers
Kazuma Satou and his party.

212
00:09:08,290 --> 00:09:09,750
[KAZUMA] Well, I'll be damned.

213
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:14,380
Something in this world
isn't a total disappointment.

214
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,790
That's a first.

215
00:09:17,710 --> 00:09:20,460
[DARKNESS] Everyone,
this is the first princess

216
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:23,710
of the kingdom
Iris Stylish-Sword Belzerg.

217
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:26,580
Please introduce yourselves
with grace and respect.

218
00:09:26,710 --> 00:09:32,420
♪

219
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:34,750
I am an arch priest
whose named Aqua.

220
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,500
This is truly an honor.

221
00:09:36,710 --> 00:09:38,500
A pleasure to make
your acquaintance.

222
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,580
[chuckles]

223
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:44,290
And now I'd like to favor you
with my new party trick.

224
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:45,630
Please pardon me!

225
00:09:45,710 --> 00:09:47,420
I just need to have
a word with my friend!

226
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,960
Hey, let go of me!

227
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,830
I was gonna show 'em
my best illusion!

228
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:51,920
[Kazuma gasps]

229
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,670
My name is Megumin, Princess,
finally, we're meet...

230
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:55,830
[screams]

231
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:58,920
[indistinct yelling]

232
00:10:02,210 --> 00:10:03,580
[KAZUMA] I've gotta say.

233
00:10:04,210 --> 00:10:06,630
That really
is one cute princess!

234
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:09,670
It seems like
she's bashful, too.

235
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:11,920
Listen Commoner.

236
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:15,710
That is no way for someone
like you to gaze upon royalty.

237
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,330
Lower your head
and make no eye contact.

238
00:10:18,460 --> 00:10:20,630
The princess demands that
you offer your introduction

239
00:10:20,710 --> 00:10:22,630
and tales of adventures
quickly.

240
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:24,170
[KAZUMA] Oh, I see.

241
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:25,630
[sighs]

242
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,880
I'm good!

243
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,750
[DARKNESS] Princess Iris,
my friends are too nervous

244
00:10:29,830 --> 00:10:31,040
to behave properly!

245
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:32,750
One moment please!

246
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:35,130
How unbelievably
cretinous can you be?

247
00:10:35,210 --> 00:10:36,710
What is wrong with you?

248
00:10:36,790 --> 00:10:38,920
I thought I had made myself
perfectly clear!

249
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,290
Ah, back off! I'm the one
who's disappointed here!

250
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:43,290
I thought I was gonna
meet a real princess!

251
00:10:43,380 --> 00:10:44,710
What the hell's goin' on?

252
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:46,830
I was expecting her
to say stuff like,

253
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,500
"Oh, I truly love hearing
all about the outside world.

254
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:51,790
Oh, brave adventurer,
please regale me

255
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,580
with tales
of your valiant exploits!"

256
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:55,460
You know that kinda crap!

257
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:57,500
This is her idea
of a great dinner party?

258
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,830
Does she think I'm stupid?

259
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,130
[AQUA] Finished!

260
00:11:00,210 --> 00:11:01,250
- Huh.
- Huh.

261
00:11:01,330 --> 00:11:02,330
[blowing]

262
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:04,790
♪

263
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:07,750
[AQUA] I want to offer this
in honor of our meeting.

264
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:10,040
I even managed to capture
your unruly bed hair,

265
00:11:10,130 --> 00:11:12,380
cause I wanted to get
every last detail.

266
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:14,000
[groans]

267
00:11:15,130 --> 00:11:17,460
Huh. [screams]

268
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:19,920
Princess Iris, let me
throw these insolent fools

269
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,130
out for you!

270
00:11:21,290 --> 00:11:24,460
[AQUA] Hey, I'm sorry.
Seriously.

271
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:26,130
Calm down, okay?

272
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:27,330
I just, uh...

273
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:29,580
[CLAIRE] "After seeing
that impressive sand portrait

274
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:31,630
created in such
a short amount of time

275
00:11:31,710 --> 00:11:33,580
and witnessing
the taciturn Lalatina

276
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:35,500
in such a state
of utter frenzy,

277
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:37,330
I will allow this," she says.

278
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:41,080
Well, then,
it is now time for dinner.

279
00:11:41,710 --> 00:11:43,920
[cutlery clanking]

280
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:47,080
- [all munching]
- [Darkness whimpering]

281
00:11:50,750 --> 00:11:52,080
It seems Mitsurugi,

282
00:11:52,170 --> 00:11:54,040
the Hero of the Cursed Sword,
spoke of you.

283
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,330
This piques her interest.

284
00:11:55,420 --> 00:11:58,170
The princess wishes
to hear that tale.

285
00:11:58,250 --> 00:12:00,080
I am rather curious, myself.

286
00:12:00,420 --> 00:12:01,630
Besting somebody like him

287
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:03,580
must not have been
a simple task.

288
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,000
[munching]

289
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,290
[swallows]

290
00:12:06,710 --> 00:12:08,040
As you wish.

291
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:11,040
[KAZUMA]
And then I used my wits

292
00:12:11,130 --> 00:12:12,920
to prepare the ultimate trap.

293
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,420
So I decided I would
act as the bait

294
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:18,210
knowing that it would create
a weakness in Sylvia!

295
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:19,960
Aah!

296
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:22,830
[whispering]

297
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,080
[CLAIRE] She says she has
never heard tales of someone

298
00:12:25,170 --> 00:12:26,540
who fights as you do.

299
00:12:26,630 --> 00:12:28,790
And that, normally,
the stories recounted

300
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,790
are all of
undefeatable champions

301
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:33,830
who slay giant monsters
with superior strength.

302
00:12:34,670 --> 00:12:35,710
[inhales deeply]

303
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,960
Well, if I may say so,
Princess.

304
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:40,750
The difference could be
that I'm constantly striving

305
00:12:40,830 --> 00:12:42,170
to become greater,

306
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:44,420
and I do it
by taking on foes I know

307
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:46,290
are much more powerful
than I am.

308
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,630
[chuckles]

309
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,880
Do you have any clue what this
wannabe hero is talking about?

310
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,080
- [whispers]
-"That's quite remarkable.

311
00:12:53,460 --> 00:12:56,040
So, what kind of work did
you do before adventuring?"

312
00:12:56,290 --> 00:12:57,290
She asked me.

313
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,920
I am interested, myself.

314
00:12:59,290 --> 00:13:00,420
Do tell us.

315
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:03,000
[groaning]

316
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:06,580
Before coming to this land
most of my hours

317
00:13:06,670 --> 00:13:08,710
were spent
defending my family's home.

318
00:13:09,130 --> 00:13:11,210
I would sharpen
my skills day after day

319
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:12,880
doing everything
I possibly could

320
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:15,630
to protect my home
from any outside threats

321
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:18,250
despite the lack
of understanding or approval.

322
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:21,380
It was a miserable
line of work.

323
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,080
I see.

324
00:13:23,290 --> 00:13:25,380
Something like
a castle guard, perhaps?

325
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:29,000
Whatever the case may be
it appears you also secured

326
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,580
your homeland anonymously.

327
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:33,000
And there were even demands
that I enter a contract

328
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,960
for three months,
at the very minimum.

329
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:37,960
So, sometimes things got rough.

330
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,380
- [Iris gasps]
- A contract?

331
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:41,790
You fought
demonic propositions alone?

332
00:13:42,290 --> 00:13:44,750
[AQUA] You were jobless.
[KAZUMA] I'm not lying, am I?

333
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:47,040
[CLAIRE]
To defeat Sir Mitsurugi

334
00:13:47,130 --> 00:13:48,170
that would mean...

335
00:13:48,830 --> 00:13:51,500
Kazuma, would it be acceptable
for me to examine

336
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:53,250
your adventurer card
immediately?

337
00:13:53,330 --> 00:13:54,460
[spitting]

338
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:57,960
[chuckles]

339
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,080
[KAZUMA] Oh man,
there's no way in hell

340
00:14:00,170 --> 00:14:02,040
I can let them see
my adventurer card!

341
00:14:02,130 --> 00:14:03,130
The second they ask me,

342
00:14:03,210 --> 00:14:04,460
"Where did you learn
a Lich skill?"

343
00:14:04,540 --> 00:14:06,290
I am gonna be so screwed!

344
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:08,420
As I'm sure you know,
Adventurers don't like

345
00:14:08,500 --> 00:14:10,040
to expose their secrets.

346
00:14:10,250 --> 00:14:11,670
Ah, that's right!

347
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:13,880
Aqua, weren't you going to
show them your special trick?

348
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,960
I'd say that sand portrait
worked out pretty well,

349
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:17,250
so I think I'm all done here.

350
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:18,880
Could I get more
of this bubbly, though?

351
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,250
This stuff is good,
bring it on!

352
00:14:20,330 --> 00:14:21,750
I can keep secrets.

353
00:14:22,330 --> 00:14:23,420
Trust me.

354
00:14:23,710 --> 00:14:25,920
Or, maybe
there's more to it than that.

355
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:29,170
[KAZUMA] Oh, yeah,
you better believe there is!

356
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:32,330
My friend is of
the very weakest class.

357
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:34,040
So, of course,
he is quite embarrassed

358
00:14:34,130 --> 00:14:35,500
to have that exposed.

359
00:14:35,580 --> 00:14:37,880
- Yeah, exactly what she said.
- [gasps]

360
00:14:38,380 --> 00:14:40,380
Between that
and what you said before.

361
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:42,960
Did you actually
defeat Sir Mitsurugi?

362
00:14:43,330 --> 00:14:45,330
[KAZUMA] Oh, it's not like
I can really admit

363
00:14:45,420 --> 00:14:47,790
to ambushing him and then
taking his cursed sword

364
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,130
with Steal!

365
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,130
- [IRIS] Huh.
- [gasps]

366
00:14:53,210 --> 00:14:54,920
- [whispering]
- [sighs]

367
00:14:55,170 --> 00:14:56,250
[all gasp]

368
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:00,000
W-well... [sighs]

369
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,540
"It is impossible for me
to believe somebody

370
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:05,250
from the weakest class
could defeat Sir Mitsurugi.

371
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:08,250
Therefore, I can only assume
that this is a lie.

372
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:10,750
He is a sword master
and quite handsome."

373
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:11,960
says the princess.

374
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:15,830
And I certainly agree
he is an attractive man.

375
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,420
That's enough, you two!

376
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:18,920
I can't take this level of...

377
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,710
- [Kazuma shrieks]
- Shut your mouth!

378
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:23,420
You presume far too much
in the presence of royalty!

379
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:24,500
[KAZUMA] Here's an idea,

380
00:15:24,580 --> 00:15:26,080
If you don't
wanna be yelled at,

381
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:28,920
maybe try being
a little less insulting?

382
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,290
I beg your pardon.

383
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:35,670
It's quite clear, my friend
has no concept of manners.

384
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:41,880
I hope you will overlook this
on my behalf.

385
00:15:42,130 --> 00:15:43,130
[IRIS] Hm.

386
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:46,210
[whispering]

387
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,830
[RAIN] "At the request
of the Dustiness family,

388
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:51,000
who has contributed
so much to this land,

389
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,710
I will ignore his insult.

390
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:54,790
However,
my mood has been soured."

391
00:15:55,290 --> 00:15:57,880
You will be rewarded
for sharing your adventures.

392
00:15:58,130 --> 00:16:00,170
But, now it is my wish
for the lying man

393
00:16:00,250 --> 00:16:03,500
of the weakest class to leave
this place immediately.

394
00:16:03,750 --> 00:16:06,250
[KAZUMA]
Ouch, that's pretty harsh.

395
00:16:06,670 --> 00:16:08,710
I'm just glad
Darkness saved my ass.

396
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,380
Let's get the hell outta here.

397
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:14,080
- Hm.
- [sword scraping]

398
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:15,670
[all gasp]

399
00:16:15,830 --> 00:16:17,920
Enough, Megumin,
what are you doing?

400
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,670
- Please stop it!
- Hey!

401
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:21,750
[groaning]

402
00:16:21,830 --> 00:16:23,750
[Kazuma gasps] Not good!

403
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:25,750
Megumin's feelin' bad
for me, now!

404
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:28,170
There's no way
she's gonna let this slide!

405
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:29,250
[grunts]

406
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:31,420
[groaning]

407
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:32,790
[sighs]

408
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:34,830
[KAZUMA] Or maybe she will

409
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:36,460
You had me worried.

410
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:38,290
I assumed you were
about to go berserk.

411
00:16:39,210 --> 00:16:41,000
They wouldn't get away
with speaking like that

412
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,830
if I were here all by myself.

413
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:44,710
But I'm not gonna
make any trouble.

414
00:16:44,790 --> 00:16:46,460
Cause I know what
that could mean for you.

415
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:47,580
Huh.

416
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:50,670
[chuckles]

417
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,170
Princess Iris.

418
00:16:54,130 --> 00:16:56,630
I must ask you
to withdraw your assertion.

419
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,580
Kazuma is not a liar.

420
00:16:58,670 --> 00:16:59,920
[all gasp]

421
00:17:00,210 --> 00:17:03,080
[DARKNESS] He might exaggerate,
rather often, in fact.

422
00:17:03,170 --> 00:17:04,750
but my friend does not lie.

423
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,790
And true, he may well
be in the weakest class,

424
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:10,000
but in times of real trouble
there is nobody

425
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:12,040
that I would rather have
at my side.

426
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:13,580
Princess Iris.

427
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:18,670
Please, would you consider
taking back your insult

428
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:20,380
and offering him an apology?

429
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:21,790
[CLAIRE] Lady Dustiness!

430
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:23,580
[gasps]

431
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,080
[groans]

432
00:17:25,330 --> 00:17:26,710
I won't do that!

433
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:29,210
[IRIS] If he really
is telling us the truth,

434
00:17:29,290 --> 00:17:31,170
then have him explain exactly
how he managed

435
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:32,790
to defeat Sir Mitsurugi!

436
00:17:33,130 --> 00:17:35,250
And if he cannot do that,
it proves he is nothing

437
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:37,080
- but a pathetic weakling who...
- [thumps]

438
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:38,330
[both gasp]

439
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,040
[gasps]

440
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:43,250
How dare you,
Lady Dustiness!

441
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:45,330
- [gasps] Wait, please, no!
- [sword slashing]

442
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,080
[both gasp]

443
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:49,130
♪

444
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:50,250
[gasps]

445
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:54,380
[DARKNESS] Princess Iris.

446
00:17:54,710 --> 00:17:55,710
Huh?

447
00:17:56,290 --> 00:17:57,290
[chuckles]

448
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:01,540
I hope you can
forgive me, truly.

449
00:18:01,630 --> 00:18:03,380
But you mustn't
say those things.

450
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:06,000
Not about someone
who has achieved so much

451
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,540
and fought so hard.

452
00:18:08,210 --> 00:18:11,130
Also, he does not need
to explain himself

453
00:18:11,210 --> 00:18:13,170
detailing Sir Mitsurugi's loss.

454
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,000
Even if he were
unable to do so,

455
00:18:16,290 --> 00:18:17,460
you would still have no right

456
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:19,210
to dishonor
my friend like that.

457
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:21,540
[sighs]

458
00:18:23,170 --> 00:18:24,210
[Megumin chuckles]

459
00:18:24,330 --> 00:18:26,000
[sighs] Fine!

460
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,210
All right, then!

461
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,750
I can't keep
my mouth shut with friends

462
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:31,790
stickin' their necks out
for me, can I?

463
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:34,540
It may not be the most
impressive thing ever,

464
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:36,210
but since you're curious,

465
00:18:36,380 --> 00:18:38,580
I can show you exactly
how I beat him.

466
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:40,290
- [grunts]
- [gasps]

467
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:41,830
No, it's all right!

468
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:44,250
I don't even care about this,
anymore, Claire!

469
00:18:44,330 --> 00:18:45,460
[KAZUMA] What's goin on?

470
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:47,290
Her whole attitudes changed.

471
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:49,420
Maybe she's sweeter
than I thought.

472
00:18:50,630 --> 00:18:52,630
I think I will just
leave it at that.

473
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,170
Okay, Kazuma?

474
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,750
I know you can handle yourself.

475
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:59,130
Damn right I can.

476
00:18:59,460 --> 00:19:01,460
[KAZUMA] I mean, look
at the people I've taken on!

477
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:03,170
Cursed sword Heroes.

478
00:19:03,330 --> 00:19:04,750
Devil King generals.

479
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:06,830
Even big-shot bounty hunters!

480
00:19:07,170 --> 00:19:09,920
And I've dealt with em all,
one by one.

481
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:13,130
First, I'll take that
nasty lookin sword!

482
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:14,830
So let's do this!

483
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,630
Steal!

484
00:19:17,710 --> 00:19:19,210
[gasps]

485
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:21,290
All right, now it's time
to show them...

486
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:22,380
[gasping]

487
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,210
[all gasp]

488
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,460
[KAZUMA] Sorry, you can, uh...

489
00:19:27,130 --> 00:19:28,420
I think these are yours?

490
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,330
[gasps] Huh.

491
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:33,630
[screams]

492
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:35,630
[DARKNESS] What in the world
is wrong with you?

493
00:19:35,790 --> 00:19:38,290
Are you capable of doing
anything right, Kazuma?

494
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:39,380
[KAZUMA] I'm sorry!

495
00:19:40,830 --> 00:19:43,210
I...uh, I apologize.

496
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:44,670
There is no need.

497
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,460
My arm has already healed.

498
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:48,250
We can both put this behind us.

499
00:19:48,330 --> 00:19:49,330
But, still...

500
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:51,830
to heal your wound
without a trace left behind.

501
00:19:52,170 --> 00:19:53,750
Not to mention
your great resilience,

502
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,080
Lady Dustiness.

503
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:58,420
And your comrade is one of
the famous Crimson Demons.

504
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,460
I can see
how you were able to defeat

505
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:02,500
the Devil Kings generals
so easily.

506
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:04,130
[Kazuma gasps]

507
00:20:04,210 --> 00:20:06,540
[CLAIRE]
But Kazuma, on the other hand.

508
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:08,710
Why am I the only one here

509
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:10,500
who's still giving
the sketchy looks?

510
00:20:10,630 --> 00:20:11,630
[gasps]

511
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:13,210
Huh.

512
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:16,460
[whispers]

513
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,080
[chuckles]

514
00:20:18,170 --> 00:20:19,830
I think that's something
you might be

515
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,080
better off saying yourself.

516
00:20:21,170 --> 00:20:22,790
- [gasps]
- Don't be concerned.

517
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:25,210
I believe Kazuma
is the type who'll go easy

518
00:20:25,290 --> 00:20:27,380
on a person like you,
Princess Iris.

519
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:28,460
[KAZUMA] Awesome.

520
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:31,210
Something tells me
I just got insulted again.

521
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:32,830
Huh?

522
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:38,040
♪

523
00:20:38,290 --> 00:20:39,290
Huh?

524
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,420
Hmm.

525
00:20:44,210 --> 00:20:46,540
I deeply regret
ever calling you a liar.

526
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:48,040
Sorry.

527
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:49,420
Hmm.

528
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,710
And if it's all right
could I hear

529
00:20:52,790 --> 00:20:54,420
more about your adventures?

530
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:57,170
[chuckles]

531
00:20:58,830 --> 00:21:00,130
With pleasure!

532
00:21:00,420 --> 00:21:03,630
♪

533
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:05,670
[CLAIRE] We'll be returning
to the castle now.

534
00:21:06,130 --> 00:21:07,670
Well, Princess Iris,

535
00:21:07,750 --> 00:21:10,920
I do hope we can speak
again when I visit the capital.

536
00:21:11,130 --> 00:21:12,420
[chuckles]

537
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:13,540
Goodbye.

538
00:21:15,290 --> 00:21:16,920
I'll see you around someday.

539
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,380
Goodbye, Princess.

540
00:21:19,330 --> 00:21:20,420
[gasps]

541
00:21:20,790 --> 00:21:22,540
Oh, what are you talking about?

542
00:21:23,460 --> 00:21:24,460
Huh?

543
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:28,040
♪

544
00:21:28,210 --> 00:21:30,040
[whimpering] Huh.

545
00:21:30,630 --> 00:21:31,630
[screams]

546
00:21:31,710 --> 00:21:35,830
♪

547
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:36,830
[both gasp]

548
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:37,920
- Princess Iris?
- Princess Iris?

549
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,040
Uh, yeah, so, what is this?

550
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:43,830
[panting]

551
00:21:44,250 --> 00:21:45,460
I'm so excited!

552
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:48,210
Now, you can tell me more
about your amazing adventures!

553
00:21:49,630 --> 00:21:51,750
[KAZUMA] Yep,
that's the monarchy for ya.

554
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:54,330
It seems like they do...

555
00:21:54,710 --> 00:21:57,250
- whatever the hell they want!
- [chuckles]

556
00:23:30,420 --> 00:23:32,250
[HANS] It's been quite
a while, Devil King.

557
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:34,880
This is Hans,
the Deadly Poison Slime.

558
00:23:35,130 --> 00:23:36,330
I've been spending my time

559
00:23:36,420 --> 00:23:38,710
selling slime detergent
by the River Styx...

